      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(ai): keep OpenAI tool call id truncation UTF-16 safe",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\n`normalizeToolCallId` in `openai-completions.ts:1052` truncates oversized OpenAI tool call IDs with `id.slice(0, 40)`. When a tool call ID contains a UTF-16 surrogate pair straddling positions 39-40, `slice` splits the pair and leaves an unpaired high surrogate — producing **invalid Unicode in the outbound API request**.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\n`String.prototype.slice(0, 40)` operates on UTF-16 code units. A surrogate pair (e.g. 🐱 `\\uD83D\\uDC31`) consumes 2 code units. The fix switches to `truncateUtf16Safe(id, 40)` from `@openclaw/normalization-core/utf16-slice`, an existing repo helper used by sibling UTF-16 PRs (#104054, #107664, #109561, #109498, #109839).\n\nSibling surfaces (non-OpenAI provider paths, other `normalizeToolCallId` branches) are unaffected — the change is scoped to the `model.provider === \"openai\"` check at line 1053.\n\nCollision check: searched open PRs for `normalizeToolCallId`, `truncateUtf16Safe`, `tool_call_id`, `surrogate pair`; no same-file or same-problem open PR was found.\n\n## User Impact\n\n- Multi-model `openai` provider tool-call conversations produce valid Unicode in all IDs\n- No change for IDs without surrogate pairs at the 40-unit boundary\n- Non-OpenAI provider paths unchanged\n\n## Evidence\n\nExact head: `27effa745e4478c0ec5aec31714984e88e7e3c84`\n\n`oxfmt --check packages/ai/src/providers/openai-completions.ts packages/ai/src/providers/openai-completions.test.ts` — passed.\n`git diff --check` — passed; exit 0.\n\n### Tests\n\n```\n$ node scripts/run-vitest.mjs packages/ai/src/providers/openai-completions.test.ts\n\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  47 passed (47)\n   Start at  16:35:17\n   Duration  3.19s\n```\n\nFull pipeline proof (test \"truncates an oversized tool call id without cutting a surrogate pair\"):\n- Input: 41-code-unit tool call ID with 🐱 surrogate pair at positions 39-40\n- Normalized ID arrives at `client.chat.completions.create` via `mockOpenAIOptionsRef.payloads`\n- `stopReason === \"stop\"` — stream completes naturally (no onPayload throw)\n- Verified normalized `tool_call_id` in API payload: 39 code units, clean ASCII (surrogate pair dropped safely)\n\n### Mutation checks\n\n- Revert `truncateUtf16Safe(id, 40)` → `id.slice(0, 40)` in `openai-completions.ts:1053` → test FAILS: `trailing high surrogate: true`. Restore → 47/47 passed.\n\n### Not tested\n\n- Live OpenAI API roundtrip with real API key\n- Non-OpenAI provider tool call ID truncation paths (unchanged)\n- Tool call IDs with multi-codepoint grapheme clusters at the boundary",
        "branch": "fix/openai-tool-call-id-utf16-truncation",
